      "> 4. Rewrite these three simple sentences as one compound sentence and then as one complex sentence: *The bus broke down. We arrived late. The examination had started.*",
      ">",
      "> 5. Write a paragraph of six sentences using at least one simple, two compound and two complex sentences, and label each.",
