      "#### Engage",
      "",
      "Three small pieces of grammar do an unusual amount of work in real life. Conditionals let you talk about what has not happened yet — every plan, warning and promise you ever make. The passive voice lets you describe a process, or report an event whose doer you do not know. And question tags are how English speakers check, soften and invite agreement a hundred times a day. You already use all three. This chapter makes them reliable.",
