      "#### Engage",
      "",
      "*The one who has not travelled thinks his mother is the best cook.* Nine words, and a whole argument about experience and judgement. Every language keeps a store of such sayings, and in Ghana that store is unusually rich — a chief's linguist can settle a dispute with one of them, and often does. A proverb is not",
      "",
