      "| Connectors | show the sequence of events | then · after that · by the time · at last |",
      "| Direct and reported speech | vary the texture and add interest | 'You knew,' she said. · Her grandmother said she had known. |",
      "| Nouns and noun phrases | name participants and objects exactly | the standpipe · the fold of her uniform |",
      "| Prepositional phrases | place the action | at the bend by the old bridge |",
      "| First-person pronouns | keep it personal | I, me, my, we, our |",
