      "",
      "*Choose the correct option in each case.* 1.A personal narrative is written in the… A. first person B. second person C. third person D. passive voice 2.Which of these is a precise alternative to *walked*? A. went B. moved C. staggered D. travelled 3.Words appealing to sight, sound, smell, taste and touch are called… A. modal verbs B. sensory language C. connectors D. imperatives",
      "",
      "4.In an advertisement, the reason why one product is better than others is called a… A. call to action B. selling point C. target audience D. title",
