      "5.*Call today. Ask for Mensah.* uses which grammatical form? A. simple present B. modal C. imperative D. mental verb",
      "",
      "6.*We believe every child should read* uses a… A. mental verb B. imperative C. adjective phrase D. adverbial",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "7.Which part of a process text should come before the steps? A. the diagram B. the materials list C. the conclusion D. the warning",
      "",
      "8.The commonest fault in a school narrative is… A. using too much direct speech B. beginning too early C. writing in the first person D. using connectors",
      "",
      "9.Which is the strongest description? A. It was dusty. B. It was very dusty. C. There was a lot of dust. D. Dust lay so thick on the leaves that she could write her name in it.",
