      "#### Section C — Listening and speaking",
      "",
      "*These tasks are carried out aloud and assessed as you perform them.* 1.Tell a personal narrative aloud to the class in two minutes, without notes. Your listeners write down three precise words and three vague ones that you used, and tell you where the story began too early or ended too late.",
