      "Two learners are asked how many pupils in the district passed last year. One says *plenty*. The other says *sixty-one per cent, according to the District Education Office's report for 2024, which is up from fifty-four the year before*. The second answer is not more intelligent. It is the answer of somebody who looked something up, wrote down where it came from, and can be checked. That habit is what research is.",
