      "",
      "#### 16.3 The elements of written literature",
      "",
      "| **Element** | **The questions it answers** |",
      "| --- | --- |",
      "| Plot | What happens? In what order? What causes what? |",
      "| Setting | Where does it happen? When? What is that place like? |",
