      "| Alliteration | the same consonant at the start of nearby words | the **b**roken **b**ucket **b**y the **b**orehole |",
      "| Assonance | the same vowel sound within nearby words | the l**o**ng r**oa**d h**o**me |",
      "| Consonance | the same consonant repeated within or at the end | the bla**ck** ro**ck** cra**ck**ed |",
